		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A stunningly beautiful, horned human with burning red eyes and a halo of seven black stars. Two stitched-up gashes weep blood from its shoulder blades.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 19, <strong>HP</strong> 76, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 iron scepter +10 (3d10) or 1 soulbind, <strong>MV</strong> far (teleport), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +7, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Crown of Darkness</strong>. All hostile spells are reflected at caster with a spellcasting check less than 20.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Fire immune. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Soulbind</strong>. All targets within near CHA 20+ or fall under control of archdevil for 1d4 rounds. CHA 20+ on turn to end the effect.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
